{"kind":"doc","route":"/guide/testing/page-stability","title":"Page stability","blocks":[{"t":"heading","level":1,"id":"page-stability","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Page stability"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A page can loop without anything failing. A component or service is rebuilt"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"over and over, a "},{"t":"code","text":"query"},{"t":"text","text":" reloads in a burst, one URL is requested fifty times a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"second: the page keeps drawing, the console stays empty, no navigation happens,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and the first symptom is a server that saturates. Assertions on what is drawn"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"all pass while the loop runs underneath."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Three tools make that visible, from development to CI:"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Tool"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Catches it…"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"link","href":"#the-loop-guard-in-development","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"the loop guard"}]}],[{"t":"text","text":"while you use the app"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"#testing-that-a-page-settles","external":false,"children":[{"t":"code","text":"expectRouteToSettle"}]}],[{"t":"text","text":"in a unit or end-to-end test"}]],[[{"t":"link","href":"#rules-that-require-the-tests","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"the rules"}]},{"t":"text","text":" (architecture, ESLint)"}],[{"t":"text","text":"when the test or the sleep is missing"}]]]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-loop-guard-in-development","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The loop guard, in development"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"provideCraftLoopGuard()"},{"t":"text","text":" counts what the runtime already sees — primitive"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"creation and destruction, loader starts, HTTP requests — over a sliding window."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"When a count crosses a threshold it reports a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"suspicion"}]},{"t":"text","text":" that names the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"primitive, its kind and its frequency, on the console, in an alert in the page,"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and on "},{"t":"code","text":"window.__CRAFT_LOOP_GUARD__"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { provideCraftLoopGuard } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"export","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"appConfig"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftAppConfig","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  providers: [","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"...","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"isDevMode","kind":"function"},{"text":"()","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":"?","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"provideCraftLoopGuard","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          tripBreaker: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"          exempt: { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'GET /api/ticker'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { httpRequests: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"60","kind":"number"},{"text":" } },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        })","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      "},{"text":":","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" []),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  ],","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It installs nothing when "},{"t":"code","text":"enabled"},{"t":"text","text":" is "},{"t":"code","text":"false"},{"t":"text","text":" or in production mode"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"("},{"t":"code","text":"provideCraftProduction()"},{"t":"text","text":"); an application that never calls it pays one"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"boolean check per primitive."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"what-it-detects","children":[{"t":"text","text":"What it detects"}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"t":"text","text":"Kind"}],[{"t":"text","text":"A suspicion when, within the window…"}],[{"t":"text","text":"Default"}]],"rows":[[[{"t":"code","text":"instantiation"}],[{"t":"text","text":"the same primitive is created again (render waves, not rows of a list)"}],[{"t":"text","text":"20"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"loader-restart"}],[{"t":"text","text":"one "},{"t":"code","text":"query"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"mutation"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"asyncProcess"},{"t":"text","text":" loader starts again"}],[{"t":"text","text":"20"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"http-burst"}],[{"t":"text","text":"one method + URL is requested (the query string is ignored)"}],[{"t":"text","text":"20"}]],[[{"t":"code","text":"leaked-instance"}],[{"t":"text","text":"instances of one primitive are alive together, each created in the window"}],[{"t":"text","text":"10"}]]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The window is 10 seconds. A poll every 5 seconds makes 2 requests in it, so a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"legitimate poll is nowhere near a threshold, while a remount loop makes tens of"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"requests per second and trips within a second. Creations a few milliseconds"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"apart count as "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"one wave"}]},{"t":"text","text":": a list drawing 200 rows at once is one creation"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"wave, not 200."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A suspicion is reported once per key per window, so a persisting loop shows its"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"growing frequency and not a flood:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"[craft:loop-guard] query:sessions in component:SessionsPage / service:sessionsList"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"was created 24 times in 10s (≈2.4/s, threshold 20). The function declaring it is"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"being re-run — a render or remount loop is likely."}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"thresholds-exceptions-circuit-breaker","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Thresholds, exceptions, circuit breaker"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"provideCraftLoopGuard","kind":"function"},{"text":"({","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  thresholds: { windowMs: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"10_000","kind":"number"},{"text":", instantiations: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"20","kind":"number"},{"text":", httpRequests: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"20","kind":"number"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  exempt: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"'GET /api/ticker'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'ignore'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// an HTTP key","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"'query:feed'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { loaderRestarts: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"60","kind":"number"},{"text":" }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// a primitive's short name","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    "},{"text":"'component:Chat*'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { instantiations: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"100","kind":"number"},{"text":" }, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// a trailing * matches a suffix","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  tripBreaker: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"true","kind":"keyword"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"onSuspected","kind":"function"},{"text":": (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"suspicion"},{"text":") ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"report","kind":"function"},{"text":"(suspicion),","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"An exception is declared, by key, in the configuration: nothing is excused"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"silently. With "},{"t":"code","text":"tripBreaker: true"},{"t":"text","text":", once a key is suspected the guard refuses"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"further instances and requests for it with a "},{"t":"code","text":"CraftLoopGuardError"},{"t":"text","text":" — the loop"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"stops, and the error says why. It is off by default."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"reading-it-from-a-bridge-or-an-agent","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Reading it from a bridge or an agent"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"An agent that investigates should not have to instrument the code. The guard"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"exposes the same information on three channels:"}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"code","text":"window.__CRAFT_LOOP_GUARD__"}]},{"t":"text","text":" with "},{"t":"code","text":"reports()"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"activity()"},{"t":"text","text":" (the rate per"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"primitive and per URL, busiest first) and "},{"t":"code","text":"reset()"},{"t":"text","text":"; "},{"t":"code","text":"craftLoopGuardReports()"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"and "},{"t":"code","text":"craftLoopGuardActivity()"},{"t":"text","text":" from "},{"t":"code","text":"@craft-ts/core"},{"t":"text","text":" read it;"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"the console"}]},{"t":"text","text":": every suspicion is a "},{"t":"code","text":"console.error"},{"t":"text","text":" starting with"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"[craft:loop-guard]"},{"t":"text","text":", so the local log server and its "},{"t":"code","text":"logs.search"},{"t":"text","text":" tool"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"already find it ("},{"t":"code","text":"logs.search"},{"t":"text","text":" with the text "},{"t":"code","text":"craft:loop-guard"},{"t":"text","text":");"}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":""},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"code","text":"onSuspected"}]},{"t":"text","text":", to forward a suspicion to any other channel."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A runtime bridge turns a suspicion into an incident by reading"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"__CRAFT_LOOP_GUARD__.reports()"},{"t":"text","text":" where it reads its other events."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"testing-that-a-page-settles","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Testing that a page settles"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"expectRouteToSettle"},{"t":"text","text":" mounts the router outlet on a url, watches the page for a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"few seconds and fails if the work it does exceeds a "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"budget"}]},{"t":"text","text":" the test states."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { expectRouteToSettle } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component/testing'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"it","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'the sessions page settles'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"expectRouteToSettle","kind":"function"},{"text":"(appRoutes.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"toRoutes","kind":"function"},{"text":"(), ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'/sessions'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    settleMs: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"1500","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    budget: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// per primitive, per key: 5 creations, 5 loader runs, 3 requests","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      creations: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"5","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      perKey: {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"// A looping asyncProcess states how many iterations the test tolerates.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"'asyncProcess:follow'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { loaderRuns: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"        "},{"text":"'GET /api/sessions'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { requests: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":" },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"      },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A failure names the offender:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"The page did not settle. Over budget:"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  - component:SessionsPage / query:sessions: 41 creations (budget 5)"}]}],"filename":"","language":"","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"expectPageToSettle(Component, { providers, act })"},{"t":"text","text":" does the same for a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"component that is not routed. Under fake timers pass"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"wait: (ms) => vi.advanceTimersByTimeAsync(ms)"},{"t":"text","text":". The helper installs the loop"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"guard with its breaker, so a runaway loop is stopped and the test fails instead"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"of freezing the runner."}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"In a browser, with Playwright:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"import","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" { expectPageToSettleInBrowser } ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"from","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"'@craft-ts/component/testing'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":";","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"test","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'the sessions page settles'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ({ ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"page"},{"text":" }) ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"expectPageToSettleInBrowser","kind":"function"},{"text":"(page, ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'/sessions'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    settleMs: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"4000","kind":"number"},{"text":",","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"    budget: { perKey: { ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'GET /api/sessions'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":": { requests: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"2","kind":"number"},{"text":" } } },","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It counts the page's "},{"t":"code","text":"fetch"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"xhr"},{"t":"text","text":" requests per method + URL — which needs"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"nothing from the application — and adds creations and loader runs when the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"application installed the loop guard."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"rules-that-require-the-tests","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Rules that require the tests"}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"route-needs-stability-test-and-looping-async-process-needs-budget","children":[{"t":"code","text":"route-needs-stability-test"},{"t":"text","text":" and "},{"t":"code","text":"looping-async-process-needs-budget"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Architecture rules, in "},{"t":"link","href":"/craft/guide/testing/architecture","external":false,"children":[{"t":"text","text":"the architecture check"}]},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"route-needs-stability-test"},{"t":"text","text":": every routed page (a route with a component) is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"named by the url of an "},{"t":"code","text":"expectRouteToSettle"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"expectPageToSettle"},{"t":"text","text":" /"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"expectPageToSettleInBrowser"},{"t":"text","text":" call in a test of the project. A "},{"t":"code","text":":param"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"segment matches any value in the url."}]}],[{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"code","text":"looping-async-process-needs-budget"},{"t":"text","text":": an "},{"t":"code","text":"asyncProcess"},{"t":"text","text":" whose loader has a"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"while"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"for"},{"t":"text","text":" driven by "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"true"},{"t":"text","text":" is named in the "},{"t":"code","text":"budget.perKey"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"of such a call, so the number of iterations a test tolerates is written down."}]}]]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"Both "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"warn"}]},{"t":"text","text":" by default and can be raised to "},{"t":"code","text":"error"},{"t":"text","text":", switched off, or waived"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"per route ("},{"t":"code","text":"target: 'route:app:sessions'"},{"t":"text","text":") or primitive"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"("},{"t":"code","text":"target: 'primitive:asyncProcess:follow'"},{"t":"text","text":") with a reason. The tests are"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"searched in the project's directory."}]},{"t":"heading","level":3,"id":"craft-ts-require-loop-sleep-or-stop","children":[{"t":"code","text":"craft-ts/require-loop-sleep-or-stop"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"ESLint. A "},{"t":"code","text":"while"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"do"},{"t":"text","text":" / "},{"t":"code","text":"for"},{"t":"text","text":" driven by "},{"t":"code","text":"yield*"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"true"},{"t":"text","text":" must suspend on"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"code","text":"craftSleep"},{"t":"text","text":" — the suspension the temporal runtime cancels when the owner is"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"destroyed, so the loop ends with it — or have a "},{"t":"code","text":"break"},{"t":"text","text":", "},{"t":"code","text":"return"},{"t":"text","text":" or "},{"t":"code","text":"throw"},{"t":"text","text":"."}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"// Reported: re-runs as fast as the runtime allows.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"while","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"following","kind":"function"},{"text":"()) {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" sessions.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"refresh","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[]},{"tokens":[{"text":"// Allowed: sleeps, and ends with its owner.","kind":"comment"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"while","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"following","kind":"function"},{"text":"()) {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"craftSleep","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"5000","kind":"number"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"yield*","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" sessions.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"refresh","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"}","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"It is in the recommended configuration."}]},{"t":"heading","level":2,"id":"the-server-is-not-the-library-s-to-test-but-budget-it","children":[{"t":"text","text":"The server is not the library's to test, but budget it"}]},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A client that does not loop still cannot save a slow endpoint: a collector that"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"revalidates 500 MB of files on every request is ~13 s per request on its own."},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"Give each endpoint a latency budget measured "},{"t":"strong","children":[{"t":"text","text":"on a realistic data set"}]},{"t":"text","text":" (the"},{"t":"text","text":" "},{"t":"text","text":"size of production, not three fixtures) as a test of the server project:"}]},{"t":"code","lines":[{"tokens":[{"text":"it","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"'GET /api/sessions answers within its budget on a realistic data set'","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":", ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" () ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"=>","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" {","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"seed","kind":"function"},{"text":"({ incidents: ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"20_000","kind":"number"},{"text":" });","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"const","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"started"},{"text":" "},{"text":"=","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" performance.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"now","kind":"function"},{"text":"();","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"await","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" "},{"text":"fetch","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"`${","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"base","kind":"string"},{"text":"}/api/sessions`","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"  "},{"text":"expect","kind":"function"},{"text":"(performance.","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"now","kind":"function"},{"text":"() ","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"-","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" started).","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"toBeLessThan","kind":"function"},{"text":"(","kind":"punctuation"},{"text":"250","kind":"number"},{"text":");","kind":"punctuation"}]},{"tokens":[{"text":"});","kind":"punctuation"}]}],"filename":"","language":"typescript","numbered":false,"firstLine":1},{"t":"paragraph","children":[{"t":"text","text":"A project created with "},{"t":"code","text":"craft new"},{"t":"text","text":" carries this reminder in its testing guide."}]}],"outline":[{"level":2,"id":"the-loop-guard-in-development","text":"The loop guard, in development"},{"level":3,"id":"what-it-detects","text":"What it detects"},{"level":3,"id":"thresholds-exceptions-circuit-breaker","text":"Thresholds, exceptions, circuit breaker"},{"level":3,"id":"reading-it-from-a-bridge-or-an-agent","text":"Reading it from a bridge or an agent"},{"level":2,"id":"testing-that-a-page-settles","text":"Testing that a page settles"},{"level":2,"id":"rules-that-require-the-tests","text":"Rules that require the tests"},{"level":3,"id":"route-needs-stability-test-and-looping-async-process-needs-budget","text":"route-needs-stability-test and looping-async-process-needs-budget"},{"level":3,"id":"craft-ts-require-loop-sleep-or-stop","text":"craft-ts/require-loop-sleep-or-stop"},{"level":2,"id":"the-server-is-not-the-library-s-to-test-but-budget-it","text":"The server is not the library's to test, but budget it"}]}